      "response": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n  <title>FAQ — Baklava Accordion</title>\n  <style>\n    :root { font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, sans-serif; color: #1c1c1c; }\n    main { max-width: 720px; margin: 2rem auto; padding: 0 1rem; }\n    h1 { font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }\n    bl-accordion-group { display: block; border: 1px solid #e3e3e3; border-radius: 8px; }\n    p { margin: 0 0 0.75rem; line-height: 1.5; }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main>\n    <h1>Frequently Asked Questions</h1>\n    <bl-accordion-group>\n      <bl-accordion caption=\"How do I reset my password?\">\n        <p>\n          On the sign-in page click \"Forgot password\", enter the email associated with your\n          account, and follow the reset link we send you. The link expires after 30 minutes.\n        </p>\n      </bl-accordion>\n      <bl-accordion caption=\"Which payment methods are supported?\">\n        <p>\n          We currently support credit and debit cards (Visa, Mastercard, Amex), bank\n          transfers, and digital wallets such as Paypal and Apple Pay.\n        </p>\n      </bl-accordion>\n      <bl-accordion caption=\"What is your return policy?\">\n        <p>\n          You may return unused items within 30 days of delivery for a full refund. The item\n          must be in its original packaging with all tags attached.\n        </p>\n      </bl-accordion>\n      <bl-accordion caption=\"How long does shipping take?\">\n        <p>\n          Standard shipping takes 3–5 business days. Express shipping arrives within 1–2\n          business days. Tracking is emailed as soon as your order ships.\n        </p>\n      </bl-accordion>\n    </bl-accordion-group>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
